      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TICKETS (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (23.71) at this track behind More Beer Please in a Grade 5. Took the lead and boxed on but run over. Comes through a solid form race last start. Good form should continue. ASTON FINNISS (1) jumped from this box last time and also the same course and distance when a 0.7 lengths third (23.72) in a Grade 5. Harder here but expected to feature again. TICK RETURNS (4) jumped well and stalked the lead before boxing on to finish third (20.46) at Traralgon in Mix 3/4. Yet to fire here from two runs. Has performed well from this box with a win and seven minor placings to her name from 14 starts. Must be included in calculations. PAW CORNELIUS (6) will be hard to beat with a drop in journey.",
